      "Anchor": "receive-exported-application-evaluation",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Receive Exported Application Evaluation"
      ],
      "Text": "All exported application evaluations can be retrieved from the Middleware Platform when a webhook event is received from the ATS partner. Use the id provided in the application evaluation webhook to access the data.",
